1
00:02:26,160 --> 00:02:28,439
[Recap]
All troops, attack!

2
00:02:28,440 --> 00:02:31,559
- Kill them!
- Raze the Sea Corpse King's capital!

3
00:02:31,560 --> 00:02:33,400
Leave no survivors!

4
00:02:34,480 --> 00:02:39,199
Seven Blood Pupils has become
rather arrogant lately.

5
00:02:39,200 --> 00:02:40,799
Order our Alliance's top prodigies

6
00:02:40,800 --> 00:02:43,080
to go and knock them down a peg.

7
00:02:44,840 --> 00:02:46,840
<i>He's here, too.</i>

8
00:02:49,280 --> 00:02:54,160
[Episode 47: Unparalleled]

9
00:03:03,200 --> 00:03:04,320
That's...

10
00:03:05,280 --> 00:03:07,520
[Sheng Yun Zi's Golden Core Guardian]

11
00:03:15,160 --> 00:03:16,639
What a powerful pressure.

12
00:03:16,640 --> 00:03:19,159
He's both a Sequence cultivator and a Taoist.

13
00:03:19,160 --> 00:03:20,839
What a grand entrance!

14
00:03:20,840 --> 00:03:22,640
He has a Life Lamp.

15
00:03:25,800 --> 00:03:27,039
This Sheng Yun Zi,

16
00:03:27,040 --> 00:03:28,399
his real name is Chu Sheng Yun.

17
00:03:28,400 --> 00:03:30,839
He holds a very high status
within the Seven-Sect Alliance.

18
00:03:30,840 --> 00:03:32,479
Among the Seven-Sect Alliance disciples,

19
00:03:32,480 --> 00:03:35,799
he's the only one with both
a Life Lamp and an Imperial Skill.

20
00:03:35,800 --> 00:03:37,759
The Lingyun Sword Sect he belongs to

21
00:03:37,760 --> 00:03:39,319
is the upper sect of the First Peak.

22
00:03:39,320 --> 00:03:40,399
The other prodigies

23
00:03:40,400 --> 00:03:42,919
are also from the upper sects
of Seven Blood Pupils' peaks.

24
00:03:42,920 --> 00:03:45,080
They're here to cause trouble.

25
00:03:47,600 --> 00:03:48,959
The upper sect has arrived.

26
00:03:48,960 --> 00:03:50,119
Forgive us for not welcoming you sooner.

27
00:03:50,120 --> 00:03:51,599
Please, excuse us.

28
00:03:51,600 --> 00:03:53,439
No matter.

29
00:03:53,440 --> 00:03:56,479
I heard the First Peak's Eldest Disciple
has defeated many strong enemies.

30
00:03:56,480 --> 00:03:58,239
The Alliance Leader wishes to mentor him.

31
00:03:58,240 --> 00:04:00,879
So, he sent the Taoist here personally

32
00:04:00,880 --> 00:04:03,119
to give him some guidance.

33
00:04:03,120 --> 00:04:06,159
Our Eldest Disciple is in seclusion
to break through to the Golden Core.

34
00:04:06,160 --> 00:04:07,479
I wonder if the upper sect...

35
00:04:07,480 --> 00:04:09,279
Seclusion?

36
00:04:09,280 --> 00:04:11,639
The Taoist is here to guide him personally.

37
00:04:11,640 --> 00:04:13,439
Don't be ungrateful.

38
00:04:13,440 --> 00:04:14,479
Well...

39
00:04:14,480 --> 00:04:18,319
First Peak was originally
a small branch of Lingyun Sword Sect.

40
00:04:18,320 --> 00:04:20,319
Living in this barbarian land for so long,

41
00:04:20,320 --> 00:04:21,999
you've even forgotten your master.

42
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:23,079
What did you say?

43
00:04:23,080 --> 00:04:24,199
[Xiao Jian Xiao, First Peak's Second Highness]
Ninth.

44
00:04:24,200 --> 00:04:25,960
- Don't be impulsive.
- But...

45
00:04:27,560 --> 00:04:29,079
<i>This Sheng Yun Zi...</i>

46
00:04:29,080 --> 00:04:30,879
<i>With 120 Dharma Apertures,</i>

47
00:04:30,880 --> 00:04:33,319
<i>an Imperial Skill, and a Life Lamp,</i>

48
00:04:33,320 --> 00:04:34,679
<i>he's not at the Golden Core stage,</i>

49
00:04:34,680 --> 00:04:36,479
<i>yet he's even stronger than one.</i>

50
00:04:36,480 --> 00:04:38,519
Sheng Yun Zi is coming on strong.

51
00:04:38,520 --> 00:04:41,720
Do you think the First Peak can withstand this?

52
00:04:42,760 --> 00:04:44,839
Junior Brother Xu? Captain?

53
00:04:44,840 --> 00:04:46,839
You're leaving already?

54
00:04:46,840 --> 00:04:47,879
I'm going to cultivate.

55
00:04:47,880 --> 00:04:49,559
The Intelligence Division has business.

56
00:04:49,560 --> 00:04:50,879
See you later.

57
00:04:50,880 --> 00:04:52,279
A scene like this

58
00:04:52,280 --> 00:04:55,399
only happens a few times in a lifetime.

59
00:04:55,400 --> 00:04:57,439
Such bullying is truly infuriating.

60
00:04:57,440 --> 00:04:59,119
I must face him, even if I die.

61
00:04:59,120 --> 00:05:00,159
Ninth.

62
00:05:00,160 --> 00:05:01,439
Let me.

63
00:05:01,440 --> 00:05:03,030
Second Senior Brother.

64
00:05:13,560 --> 00:05:15,479
I've long heard of the Taoist's fame.

65
00:05:15,480 --> 00:05:16,799
On behalf of my Eldest Senior Brother,

66
00:05:16,800 --> 00:05:18,279
I'd like to ask for your guidance.

67
00:05:18,280 --> 00:05:21,319
You're just a mere child.

68
00:05:21,320 --> 00:05:23,119
Fine.

69
00:05:23,120 --> 00:05:27,639
Then please move to the First Peak's arena.

70
00:05:27,640 --> 00:05:28,919
[First Peak's Arena]

71
00:05:28,920 --> 00:05:30,279
With Sheng Yun Zi here in person,

72
00:05:30,280 --> 00:05:32,279
the First Peak is in grave danger.

73
00:05:32,280 --> 00:05:33,639
I wouldn't be so sure.

74
00:05:33,640 --> 00:05:35,559
Seven Blood Pupils has many geniuses.

75
00:05:35,560 --> 00:05:38,640
Lingyun Sword Sect might not win easily.

76
00:05:40,920 --> 00:05:43,119
What a mediocre opponent.

77
00:05:43,120 --> 00:05:47,999
This duel will be incredibly boring.

78
00:05:48,000 --> 00:05:50,239
Make your move.

79
00:05:50,240 --> 00:05:52,279
<i>His cultivation far exceeds mine.</i>

80
00:05:52,280 --> 00:05:54,039
<i>I only have one chance.</i>

81
00:05:54,040 --> 00:05:56,480
<i>I must give it my all.</i>

82
00:06:06,880 --> 00:06:09,279
<i>Even if I die today,</i>

83
00:06:09,280 --> 00:06:12,800
<i>I won't let outsiders trample our dignity.</i>

84
00:06:13,640 --> 00:06:15,744
Xuan Yao State!

85
00:06:15,745 --> 00:06:17,039
Activate!

86
00:06:17,040 --> 00:06:20,440
[Xiao Jian Xiao, Xuan Yao State]

87
00:06:37,320 --> 00:06:38,919
[Nine-Turn Sword Art]

88
00:06:38,920 --> 00:06:41,360
Sword Formation!

89
00:06:42,920 --> 00:06:45,919
That's the Second Highness's core skill.

90
00:06:45,920 --> 00:06:48,599
<i>He's going to use that move.</i>

91
00:06:48,600 --> 00:06:50,520
Interesting.

92
00:06:59,360 --> 00:07:02,559
A thousand blades shake the heavens.

93
00:07:02,560 --> 00:07:04,599
Once this edge is drawn,

94
00:07:04,600 --> 00:07:06,840
ten thousand mountains bow.

95
00:07:10,160 --> 00:07:12,319
Nine-Turn Sword Art.

96
00:07:12,320 --> 00:07:14,360
Ninth Form.

97
00:07:23,720 --> 00:07:28,480
[Sword King Dharma Form]
[True Dharma Form]

98
00:07:30,000 --> 00:07:32,440
Heaven-Splitting Night-Light!

99
00:07:45,480 --> 00:07:46,960
Go!

100
00:08:02,000 --> 00:08:04,160
<i>I can't break through
his Life Lamp's protection.</i>

101
00:08:10,800 --> 00:08:11,879
Could it be...

102
00:08:11,880 --> 00:08:15,160
Break... for me!

103
00:08:17,000 --> 00:08:18,520
Good grief!

104
00:08:24,760 --> 00:08:27,519
Do you know what it means

105
00:08:27,520 --> 00:08:30,440
to strike a rock with an egg?

106
00:08:31,520 --> 00:08:32,932
What?

107
00:08:37,120 --> 00:08:38,719
<i>My full-strength strike</i>

108
00:08:38,720 --> 00:08:41,880
<i>was blocked by him so easily.</i>

109
00:08:43,240 --> 00:08:45,120
Taoist, please wait!

110
00:08:49,120 --> 00:08:50,840
A Golden Core!

111
00:09:10,520 --> 00:09:12,439
For the Taoist's guidance,

112
00:09:12,440 --> 00:09:14,679
our peak is grateful.

113
00:09:14,680 --> 00:09:15,719
Elder!

114
00:09:15,720 --> 00:09:16,839
Second Senior Brother!

115
00:09:16,840 --> 00:09:18,599
Quickly! Save him!

116
00:09:18,600 --> 00:09:19,719
Senior Brother!

117
00:09:19,720 --> 00:09:21,119
Quick, bring a healing pill!

118
00:09:21,120 --> 00:09:22,439
Are you all right?

119
00:09:22,440 --> 00:09:24,519
The First Peak is utterly defeated.

120
00:09:24,520 --> 00:09:26,639
One strike actually forced back
a Golden Core elder.

121
00:09:26,640 --> 00:09:27,839
The fight is over.

122
00:09:27,840 --> 00:09:30,639
It's time for us to "guide"
our respective lower sects.

123
00:09:30,640 --> 00:09:31,879
A great fight.

124
00:09:31,880 --> 00:09:33,119
How boring.

125
00:09:33,120 --> 00:09:36,840
I hope the Seventh Peak has some surprises.

126
00:09:46,760 --> 00:09:49,399
<i>Junior Brother Xu, do you know what happened?</i>

127
00:09:49,400 --> 00:09:52,919
That Sheng Yun Zi... is simply terrifying.

128
00:09:52,920 --> 00:09:56,239
I could only feel
that moment of extreme pressure.

129
00:09:56,240 --> 00:09:58,279
The Second Highness lost in one move.

130
00:09:58,280 --> 00:10:00,239
If the First Peak's
Golden Core elder hadn't intervened,

131
00:10:00,240 --> 00:10:02,639
his cultivation might've been
completely destroyed.

132
00:10:02,640 --> 00:10:04,199
Sheng Yun Zi is extremely dangerous.

133
00:10:04,200 --> 00:10:06,359
Junior Brother Xu, as a Core Disciple,

134
00:10:06,360 --> 00:10:07,639
<i>you must be careful in the days to come.</i>

135
00:10:07,640 --> 00:10:09,760
Thanks for the warning, Senior Brother Zhang.

136
00:10:16,280 --> 00:10:21,590
<i>The wish box I got from Ma Si
is almost fully nurtured.</i>

137
00:10:23,120 --> 00:10:25,719
I wonder what it will yield.

138
00:10:25,720 --> 00:10:27,519
There are 3,000 Great Taos,

139
00:10:27,520 --> 00:10:29,439
and all can lead to sainthood.

140
00:10:29,440 --> 00:10:31,599
The world looks down on the path of poison.

141
00:10:31,600 --> 00:10:32,639
However...

142
00:10:32,640 --> 00:10:35,399
I once killed a poison cultivator
from a divine domain.

143
00:10:35,400 --> 00:10:37,039
I was afflicted by his insidious poison.

144
00:10:37,040 --> 00:10:37,679
[Ancient Illusory Phantom]

145
00:10:37,680 --> 00:10:40,279
Only then did I realize
the power of the path of poison.

146
00:10:40,280 --> 00:10:42,839
I condensed that poison into a single pill.

147
00:10:42,840 --> 00:10:45,199
By replacing your core with this pill,

148
00:10:45,200 --> 00:10:48,199
you can walk the path of the Forbidden Pill.
[Forbidden Poison Pill]

149
00:10:48,200 --> 00:10:50,719
Shake all living beings with poison.

150
00:10:50,720 --> 00:10:53,959
Annihilate all for eternity.

151
00:10:53,960 --> 00:10:56,399
<i>Replacing the Golden Core with a Poison Core...</i>

152
00:10:56,400 --> 00:10:58,919
This... this...

153
00:10:58,920 --> 00:11:02,119
Good grief. Master, your face!

154
00:11:02,120 --> 00:11:03,999
<i>This poison causes no pain at all.</i>

155
00:11:04,000 --> 00:11:05,960
<i>It's hard to detect.</i>

156
00:11:10,000 --> 00:11:11,200
Close.

157
00:11:12,920 --> 00:11:14,479
<i>If the speed at which this poison spreads</i>

158
00:11:14,480 --> 00:11:16,919
<i>exceeds the amethyst's recovery speed,</i>

159
00:11:16,920 --> 00:11:19,440
<i>I'm afraid I'll be beyond redemption.</i>

160
00:11:20,680 --> 00:11:22,440
<i>This poison is incredibly potent.</i>

161
00:11:23,320 --> 00:11:26,600
<i>I wonder if the poisonous insects
can evolve under its influence.</i>

162
00:11:29,320 --> 00:11:31,999
<i>If I feed them with my blood,</i>

163
00:11:32,000 --> 00:11:34,879
<i>I might be able to boost their resistance.</i>

164
00:11:34,880 --> 00:11:36,400
<i>Let's try it.</i>

165
00:11:42,200 --> 00:11:43,639
Seventh.

166
00:11:43,640 --> 00:11:47,279
The Alliance sent these prodigies
to challenge each peak in turn.

167
00:11:47,280 --> 00:11:49,719
The sect is in a state of unrest.

168
00:11:49,720 --> 00:11:51,839
While you and I are idling here,

169
00:11:51,840 --> 00:11:53,999
aren't you worried?

170
00:11:54,000 --> 00:11:55,919
It's fine.

171
00:11:55,920 --> 00:12:00,079
Let these wolf cubs experience the talent
of the Wanggu Continent early.

172
00:12:00,080 --> 00:12:02,000
It's a good thing.

173
00:12:04,520 --> 00:12:06,160
<i>There's a change.</i>

174
00:12:11,720 --> 00:12:13,040
It worked.

175
00:12:22,920 --> 00:12:25,119
<i>Though not many poisonous insects survived,</i>

176
00:12:25,120 --> 00:12:27,920
<i>at least it proves this step was correct.</i>

177
00:12:34,240 --> 00:12:38,119
<i>Sir, Sima Ling, the prodigy of Hunter Sect,
has appeared at Port 79.</i>

178
00:12:38,120 --> 00:12:39,799
<i>He's conducting a deal with Night Dove.</i>

179
00:12:39,800 --> 00:12:41,439
<i>Hunter Sect.</i>

180
00:12:41,440 --> 00:12:43,639
<i>Sima Ling.</i>

181
00:12:43,640 --> 00:12:45,159
Keep your eyes peeled.

182
00:12:45,160 --> 00:12:46,479
Before the transaction is complete,

183
00:12:46,480 --> 00:12:48,479
nothing must go wrong.

184
00:12:48,480 --> 00:12:50,119
Yes, sir!

185
00:12:50,120 --> 00:12:52,759
<i>Is this all the goods they have?</i>

186
00:12:52,760 --> 00:12:54,239
This batch of goods...

187
00:12:54,240 --> 00:12:55,839
is far too little.

188
00:12:55,840 --> 00:12:57,079
Please forgive us, Your Highness.

189
00:12:57,080 --> 00:12:58,614
The Seven Blood Pupils' Capturers' Division
[Night Dove Leader]

190
00:12:58,615 --> 00:13:00,559
is extremely hostile to us Night Doves.

191
00:13:00,560 --> 00:13:02,199
Especially that Division Commander, Xu Qing.

192
00:13:02,200 --> 00:13:04,440
He attacked our convoy.

193
00:13:05,200 --> 00:13:06,919
Even for this transaction,

194
00:13:06,920 --> 00:13:08,879
we are taking a huge risk.

195
00:13:08,880 --> 00:13:11,479
They're just a bunch of lowly branch disciples
from a minor sect.

196
00:13:11,480 --> 00:13:13,439
Do they really think they can defy us?

197
00:13:13,440 --> 00:13:15,039
I'd like to see

198
00:13:15,040 --> 00:13:18,960
if Xu Qing really dares to interfere
with the upper sect's business.

199
00:13:20,640 --> 00:13:21,879
By order of the Division Commander,

200
00:13:21,880 --> 00:13:23,479
arrest the Night Doves!

201
00:13:23,480 --> 00:13:25,079
Everyone involved in the transaction

202
00:13:25,080 --> 00:13:26,359
is to be taken into custody!

203
00:13:26,360 --> 00:13:28,199
Yes, sir!

204
00:13:28,200 --> 00:13:29,919
The Capturers' Division!

205
00:13:29,920 --> 00:13:31,680
How insolent!

206
00:13:45,800 --> 00:13:47,239
You're just a bunch of riffraff!

207
00:13:47,240 --> 00:13:49,639
How dare you obstruct the upper sect?

208
00:13:49,640 --> 00:13:51,399
With me here,

209
00:13:51,400 --> 00:13:53,919
I'll see who dares to touch a hair on them!

210
00:13:53,920 --> 00:13:55,880
Continue loading the ship!

211
00:14:04,880 --> 00:14:06,479
My face!

212
00:14:06,480 --> 00:14:08,000
Who is it?

213
00:14:09,880 --> 00:14:11,119
It's the Division Commander!

214
00:14:11,120 --> 00:14:13,080
The Division Commander is finally here!

215
00:14:15,200 --> 00:14:17,839
You lowly official of a subordinate sect!

216
00:14:17,840 --> 00:14:21,280
How dare you interfere
with the Sima family's business?

217
00:14:23,920 --> 00:14:27,320
Arrest every Night Dove here.

218
00:14:29,080 --> 00:14:32,319
Anyone who resists is to be killed on the spot!

219
00:14:32,320 --> 00:14:36,119
By your command!

220
00:14:36,120 --> 00:14:37,159
Run!

221
00:14:37,160 --> 00:14:38,479
If we fall into Xu Qing's hands,

222
00:14:38,480 --> 00:14:40,280
we'll wish we were dead!

223
00:14:40,920 --> 00:14:43,919
You cowards who fear death!

224
00:14:43,920 --> 00:14:48,119
With me here, what is there to fear?

225
00:14:48,120 --> 00:14:49,519
Xu Qing!

226
00:14:49,520 --> 00:14:52,799
You lowly commoner from a barbaric sect!

227
00:14:52,800 --> 00:14:55,119
How dare you defy your superiors?

228
00:14:55,120 --> 00:15:00,320
I'll show you the majesty of the upper sect!
[Almighty Deathair Skill]

229
00:15:08,520 --> 00:15:10,240
Is that so?

230
00:15:14,266 --> 00:15:15,746
That is...

231
00:15:17,240 --> 00:15:18,840
Get over here!

232
00:15:28,480 --> 00:15:30,519
How can he be so powerful?

233
00:15:30,520 --> 00:15:32,719
He reached the Four-Fire state in an instant!

234
00:15:32,720 --> 00:15:35,279
The Grand Alliance's
Golden Crow Refines All Spirits!

235
00:15:35,280 --> 00:15:37,319
A mere disciple of a subordinate sect...

236
00:15:37,320 --> 00:15:40,439
How can you cultivate an Imperial Skill?

237
00:15:40,440 --> 00:15:42,519
You lowly bastard!

238
00:15:42,520 --> 00:15:45,079
I'll grind your bones to dust today...

239
00:15:45,080 --> 00:15:47,920
to quench my hatred!

240
00:15:50,400 --> 00:15:54,119
Phantoms arise, demons rejoice.

241
00:15:54,120 --> 00:15:55,719
Death's tribulation arrives,

242
00:15:55,720 --> 00:16:00,160
sending you to the Netherworld!

243
00:16:02,680 --> 00:16:05,600
[Spirit-Sealing Souldraw,
Spirit-Sealing Anomaly Art]

244
00:16:06,520 --> 00:16:11,079
Those eyes of yours... are truly loathsome.

245
00:16:11,080 --> 00:16:13,879
I'm going to gouge them out...

246
00:16:13,880 --> 00:16:16,679
and seal your path to the abyss!

247
00:16:16,680 --> 00:16:18,880
Time's up.

248
00:16:30,873 --> 00:16:32,353
Poison?

249
00:16:33,213 --> 00:16:35,013
When did he...

250
00:16:41,840 --> 00:16:43,119
You...

251
00:16:43,120 --> 00:16:45,520
It's time to pay for your crimes.

252
00:16:47,680 --> 00:16:49,639
Damn it!

253
00:16:49,640 --> 00:16:52,759
This poison is generating
a massive amount of alien taint!

254
00:16:52,760 --> 00:16:56,120
The anomaly in my body is losing control!

255
00:16:57,320 --> 00:16:58,778
Extinguish!

256
00:17:01,720 --> 00:17:03,960
Quickly, help me!

257
00:17:07,200 --> 00:17:09,959
[Sima Ling's Golden Core Guardian]
How dare you harm our young master!

258
00:17:09,960 --> 00:17:11,680
You're courting death!

259
00:17:12,720 --> 00:17:15,119
By my authority as
a Seven Blood Pupils Sequence disciple,

260
00:17:15,120 --> 00:17:17,999
and Chief of the Seventh Peak
Capturers' Division,

261
00:17:18,000 --> 00:17:20,999
I request the Sect's Grand Array...

262
00:17:21,000 --> 00:17:24,320
to suppress those interfering
with law enforcement!

263
00:17:33,080 --> 00:17:34,680
What?

264
00:17:35,520 --> 00:17:37,320
Kneel!

265
00:17:42,160 --> 00:17:44,119
Well done, Commander!

266
00:17:44,120 --> 00:17:46,519
Settle the score for the First Peak!

267
00:17:46,520 --> 00:17:48,319
A mere official of a branch sect...

268
00:17:48,320 --> 00:17:51,239
dares to make me kneel?

269
00:17:51,240 --> 00:17:52,479
Xu Qing!

270
00:17:52,480 --> 00:17:54,600
How dare you!

271
00:18:02,240 --> 00:18:03,639
You brat!

272
00:18:03,640 --> 00:18:06,280
Are you trying to start a rebellion?

273
00:18:11,573 --> 00:18:12,853
Begone!

274
00:18:15,800 --> 00:18:17,479
Sima Ling of the Hunter Sect,

275
00:18:17,480 --> 00:18:19,959
you conspired with the Night Dove
and resisted law enforcement.

276
00:18:19,960 --> 00:18:21,639
Your crimes are unforgivable.

277
00:18:21,640 --> 00:18:23,479
By the laws of the sect,

278
00:18:23,480 --> 00:18:25,119
you shall be suppressed...

279
00:18:25,120 --> 00:18:27,320
as a warning to others.

280
00:18:34,520 --> 00:18:39,519
Xu Qing, who are you to judge me?

281
00:18:39,520 --> 00:18:41,079
I am a prodigy!

282
00:18:41,080 --> 00:18:44,840
A prodigy of the Hunter Sect!

283
00:18:53,600 --> 00:18:55,200
A prodigy?

284
00:18:56,680 --> 00:18:59,360
It is the prodigies I suppress.

285
00:19:53,280 --> 00:19:55,079
Put 20 Dharma Rings on him.

286
00:19:55,080 --> 00:19:57,400
Throw him into the Capturers' Division dungeon.

287
00:19:58,640 --> 00:20:00,959
Execute all the Night Doves on the spot.

288
00:20:00,960 --> 00:20:02,639
Expose their corpses on the city walls

289
00:20:02,640 --> 00:20:04,219
as a warning to all.

290
00:20:04,220 --> 00:20:05,820
Yes, sir!

291
00:20:17,400 --> 00:20:21,680
[Secret Art, Illusory Phantom]

292
00:20:28,000 --> 00:20:30,599
A Spirit-Infused Artifact.

293
00:20:30,600 --> 00:20:32,439
Two Life Fires.

294
00:20:32,440 --> 00:20:34,279
More than two.

295
00:20:34,280 --> 00:20:37,040
He also possesses
an Imperial Grade Cultivation Art.

296
00:20:38,280 --> 00:20:40,439
The Golden Crow.

297
00:20:40,440 --> 00:20:43,840
Sima Ling... underestimated him.

298
00:20:49,560 --> 00:20:53,552
Seven Blood Pupils... is hiding its strength.

299
00:20:53,553 --> 00:20:56,673
Wolves will always crave meat.

300
00:21:08,239 --> 00:21:09,879
Mie Meng...

301
00:21:10,920 --> 00:21:13,640
Now is not the time yet.

302
00:21:14,560 --> 00:21:16,639
Only by constantly growing stronger

303
00:21:16,640 --> 00:21:19,479
can one remain invincible.

304
00:21:19,480 --> 00:21:21,880
No one is an exception.

305
00:21:23,480 --> 00:21:25,080
Let's go.

306
00:21:28,400 --> 00:21:30,119
<i>Moving against Sima Ling this time</i>

307
00:21:30,120 --> 00:21:32,039
<i>has caused quite a stir.</i>

308
00:21:32,040 --> 00:21:33,959
<i>But I obtained the sect's permission
in advance,</i>

309
00:21:33,960 --> 00:21:35,759
<i>so it should be fine.</i>

310
00:21:35,760 --> 00:21:37,039
<i>However...</i>

311
00:21:37,040 --> 00:21:38,759
<i>the Seven-Sect Alliance's arrival
is aggressive.</i>

312
00:21:38,760 --> 00:21:39,719
[Sima Ling's Storage Pouch]

313
00:21:39,720 --> 00:21:41,759
<i>A storm is brewing.</i>

314
00:21:41,760 --> 00:21:45,200
<i>My trump cards... need to be even stronger.</i>

315
00:21:51,080 --> 00:21:56,559
[It is the prodigies I suppress]

316
00:21:56,560 --> 00:21:58,159
[Seven Blood Pupils' Sect Grand Array:
Can be activated by prominent peak members.]

317
00:21:58,160 --> 00:21:59,799
[It covers the entire main city,
keeps alien taint out, and boosts longevity.]

318
00:21:59,800 --> 00:22:01,440
[It can also suppress cultivation,
teleport disciples, eliminate felons, etc.]

319
00:22:02,000 --> 00:22:18,720
[Preview]

